1
00:00:00,286 --> 00:00:02,286
(Penny:)What's Mrs. Riley's chicken?

2
00:00:03,164 --> 00:00:06,454
(Sheldon:)A chicken that was owned
by Mrs. Riley.

3
00:00:06,626 --> 00:00:10,216
(Penny:)-Okay, forget the chicken.
-I wish I could.

4
00:00:11,881 --> 00:00:14,091
(Howard:)No, no.
You may be right about me and Leonard.

5
00:00:14,259 --> 00:00:18,259
Well, of course I'm right. What are the
odds I'd be wrong twice in one week?

6
00:00:18,429 --> 00:00:21,099
(Penny:)No, I mean,
we can always go back to being friends.

7
00:00:21,266 --> 00:00:25,146
(Sheldon:)I just said that-- This conversation
has started to circle. Meeting adjourned.

8
00:00:30,316 --> 00:00:32,196
(Sheldon:)-Hello.
-Hey.

9
00:00:32,360 --> 00:00:34,240
(Leonard:)What's going on?

10
00:00:34,863 --> 00:00:37,863
(Sheldon:)Oh, you'd like to catch up
on the events of the day. All right.

11
00:00:38,032 --> 00:00:41,782
(Sheldon:)Well, there was a half-hour wait at the
bank to get into my safe-deposit box.

12
00:00:41,953 --> 00:00:44,703
(Sheldon:)I was forced to talk to Penny
about your sexual problems.

13
00:00:44,873 --> 00:00:48,083
(Sheldon:)And, oh, yes, in a moment filled
with biblical resonance...

14
00:00:48,251 --> 00:00:49,921
(Sheldon:)...pride wenteth before my fall...

15
00:00:50,086 --> 00:00:54,086
(Sheldon:)...causing my Flash 123
to goeth to Wolowitz.

16
00:00:54,549 --> 00:00:57,889
(Leonard:)Wait a minute.
You talked to Penny about our sex life?

17
00:00:58,052 --> 00:01:01,472
(Sheldon:)Leonard, it astonishes me
how you continually fixate on the trivial.

